# Client Development Rules

## React Component Guidelines
- Use functional components with TypeScript
- Co-locate component tests with the component
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling
- Extract reusable components to `libs/shared/ui/`

## State Management
- Prefer server state (React Query / tRPC) over client state
- Use React Context only for UI state (theme, sidebar open/closed)
